PostgreSQL
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The released artifacts (pglite.wasi, pglite-wasi.tar.xz,
pgdata-pristine.tar.xz) are builds of PostgreSQL 17.5, taken from the
electric-sql/postgres-pglite fork (branch REL_17_5_WASM-pglite; the exact
commit is pinned in build/versions.env). PostgreSQL and that fork are
distributed under the PostgreSQL License, reproduced in the COPYRIGHT
file shipped alongside the artifacts and inside pglite-wasi.tar.xz:

    Portions Copyright (c) 1996-2025, PostgreSQL Global Development Group
    Portions Copyright (c) 1994, The Regents of the University of California

The patches under build/patches/ are modifications of that source tree
and are likewise governed by the PostgreSQL License; see
build/patches/README.md.

