Go module dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Go library depends on modules fetched at build time by consumers
(github.com/jackc/pgx/v5 — MIT; github.com/tetratelabs/wazero —
Apache-2.0; github.com/ulikunitz/xz — BSD-3-Clause). They are not
redistributed in this repository or in the bundle artifacts; their
licenses accompany the modules themselves.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
wasi-libc / wasi-sdk
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The PostgreSQL module and gate/testdata/sjlj.wasm statically link
wasi-libc from wasi-sdk 33, distributed under
"Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception OR Apache-2.0 OR MIT". The shadow headers
under build/hotfix/ are derived from wasi-libc headers.
